      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1755604667801,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ScoreManager\n----------\nMainActor that handles local and remote raw data scoring with realtime\nlisteners for each player or team in a group, plus polling for other player's\nin the larger party. Data entity driven by Scoring Method.\n\nScoring will be individual for most games, but definition could also drive\nsingle inputted group score (for capt choice or alt shot).\n\nNo scoring computation, purely data management. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rVBuJ7-MB7qdJiy4dezX0",
      "originalText": "ScoreManager\n----------\nMainActor that handles local and remote raw data scoring with realtime listeners for each player or team in a group, plus polling for other player's in the larger party. Data entity driven by Scoring Method.\n\nScoring will be individual for most games, but definition could also drive single inputted group score (for capt choice or alt shot).\n\nNo scoring computation, purely data management. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
